#. type: Title #
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "013 — Code review"
msgstr "013 — Code review"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
msgid "Code reviews are essential for the success of the project and are as important as contributing code."
msgstr "Code reviews são essenciais para o sucesso do projeto e tão importantes quanto contribuir com código."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
msgid "Reviews are handled via GitHub pull requests. When the request is ready for review, the \"status: code review\" label is added to it."
msgstr "As revisões são feitas por meio de pull requests no GitHub. Quando o pull request está pronto para revisão, recebe o label \"status: code review\"."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
msgid "[A full list of pull requests that need review](https://github.com/search?q=org%3Ayiisoft+label%3A\"status%3Acode+review\"&state=open&type=Issues)  is available at GitHub."
msgstr "[A lista completa de pull requests que precisam de revisão](https://github.com/search?q=org%3Ayiisoft+label%3A\"status%3Acode+review\"&state=open&type=Issues)  está disponível no GitHub."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Guidelines"
msgstr "Diretrizes"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
msgid "Check out the pull request branch, open the project in the IDE, get a big picture."
msgstr "Faça checkout do branch do pull request, abra o projeto na IDE e tenha uma visão geral."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
msgid "Does the pull request make sense overall?"
msgstr "O pull request faz sentido como um todo?"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
msgid "Run tests and/or application using code from the pull request. Are these OK?"
msgstr "Rode os testes e/ou a aplicação usando o código do pull request. Está tudo certo?"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
msgid "Read all lines of code in the pull request."
msgstr "Leia todas as linhas de código do pull request."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
msgid "Could it be done simpler?"
msgstr "Daria para fazer de forma mais simples?"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
msgid "Are there security issues?"
msgstr "Há problemas de segurança?"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
msgid "Are there performance issues?"
msgstr "Há problemas de desempenho?"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
msgid "When leaving comments, be polite."
msgstr "Ao deixar comentários, seja educado."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
msgid "Avoid code-formatting comments."
msgstr "Evite comentários sobre formatação de código."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mandatory parts"
msgstr "Itens obrigatórios"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
msgid "[ ] Tests that fail without code and pass with code."
msgstr "[ ] Testes que falham sem o código e passam com ele."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
msgid "[ ] Type hints."
msgstr "[ ] Type hints."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
msgid "[ ] `declare(strict_types=1)`."
msgstr "[ ] `declare(strict_types=1)`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
msgid "[ ] Documentation: phpdoc, yiisoft/docs."
msgstr "[ ] Documentação: phpdoc, yiisoft/docs."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/en/internals/013-code-review.md
msgid "[ ] Changelog entry (if package is stable)."
msgstr "[ ] Entrada no changelog (se o pacote for estável)."
